      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>2025年4月1日</color>\n各位旅行者大家好！最新的《原神》表情包於HoYoLAB上線了！\n派蒙的畫作囊括了《原神》裡眾多角色的Q版表情包，希望大家喜歡！今後派蒙仍會努力畫出讓大家喜愛的作品！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/10/7504171/f3b6846a2ac9048f319bfccc3ed4999f_5696853061529871878.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>白色情人節2026</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/10/7504171/0be52d1a9a668d30f05d03db32147094_5379905035367817613.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>2026年3月14日</color>\n唔…呀呀！呀呀呀！\n( 黃色的，香噴噴！送給你，開心！)"
      },
      {
